usage: pack zlib [options]

Options:
  --out <str>         Write the zlib stream to this file (required)
  --level <int>       Compression level, 0 (store) to 9; giving one streams the file
  --sync-every <int>  End a block with a sync flush every this many input bytes
Arguments:
  <inputs>...         The files to compress, one after another into one stream
